{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00759","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 送神 · 王涯","name":"郊庙歌辞 享惠昭太子庙乐章 送神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"威仪毕陈，备乐将阕。\n苞茅酒缩，膋萧香彻。\n宫臣展事，肃雍在列。\n迎精送往，厥鉴昭晰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00759.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00759","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}